# One address per line. This is the list `.githooks/pre-commit` checks against,
# and it must mirror the Vercel TEAM MEMBERSHIP for the barcodesqr project — the
# hook cannot see Vercel, so an address here that is not on the team simply
# moves the failure from a local refusal to a blocked deployment.
#
# Adding somebody: put them on the Vercel team FIRST, then add the address they
# actually commit with. That is their git `user.email`, which is often not the
# address they log into GitHub with — check `git log --format='%ae'` rather than
# guessing.

